    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d238ada3-8a15-5bce-9e56-7800a677e975" activityNameId="43555c0a-b5a8-56f2-a2a6-9b15d2792dad" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sputtering, ITO, for LCD</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sputtering, ITO, for LCD
This dataset is established for the manufacturing of LCD screens. Due to a lack of structured data the inventory bases on assumptions and lab-scale technology. Direct process emissions are not known and disregarded. The dataset therefore must not be used for the direct comparison of different film deposition technologies. The functional unit of this dataset is cubic meter resulting from the sputtered area times the film thickness. Film thickness depends on display technology: STN LCD: 150nm top;
Synonyms: Indium Tin Oxide, Indium Zinn Oxid, TFT, Transparent and conductive Oxide Layer, TCO, physical vapour deposition, PVD; 
UUID: b163e170-367e-34c5-9ee8-97f3839e238f
Sputtering process and infrastructure, as well as the transportation of the targets. No pre and post treatment of the surfaces are considered. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Relates to RF magentron sputtering techniquewith commercially available sputtering targets. Pre-sputtering phase and subsequent main sputtering.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see General Comments
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b163e170-367e-34c5-9ee8-97f3839e238f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
